## Scoring Formula

Composite Score =
0.35 x MHC Binding Score +
0.25 x Antigen Presentation Score +
0.25 x Evidence Score +
0.15 x Mutation Impact Score

Scores are normalized to the range 0-1. Higher scores indicate stronger computational priority for research follow-up.

